      <activity id="f83b8ed2-be60-5626-9ea2-c0b2eb544827" activityNameId="ef4173ab-1b7b-574d-83e7-28b9abb915ca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, passenger car
Average data for the operation of an average passenger car (fleet average) Switzerland in the year 2005, comprising various emission technologies.;
UUID: eb843160-3145-3e22-acfa-dace76f53b15
Fuel consumption is included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Particulate emissions comprise exhaust- and abrasions emissions. Hydrocarbon emissions include evaporation. Heavy metal emissions to soil and water caused by tyre abrasion are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: diesel and petrol cars
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 53689 Mio.vkm/a
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb843160-3145-3e22-acfa-dace76f53b15.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
